# Build context whitelist for the console-admin image. Mirror of
# web/dashboard/Containerfile.ignore -- see that file for why the context is the
# repository root, why this is a whitelist rather than a denylist, and why each
# console image carries its own.
*
!ui
!web/package.json
!web/bun.lock
!web/bunfig.toml
!web/tsconfig.base.json
!web/sorted-readdir.mjs
!web/serve-node.js
!web/kit
!web/admin

# Manifest only, so `bun install --frozen-lockfile` can resolve the workspace
# graph without pulling in the sources (or the toolchains) of members this image
# never runs.
!web/dashboard/package.json
!web/marketing/package.json
!web/docs/package.json

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.svelte-kit
**/.astro
**/test-results
**/*.log
